# ТЗ Management

- All new specifications are created in `ТЗ/` folder.
- New specification status is always `WAIT_DEV`.
- Status must be included in file name: `YYYY-MM-DD__STATUS__task-name.md`.
- Keep `ТЗ/REGISTRY.md` synchronized with any specification changes.
- Suggested status flow: `WAIT_DEV -> IN_DEV -> ON_REVIEW -> DONE`.
